  lex_strings_err_escape.pcpp - break step of lex_strings.pcpp:
  an octal escape above 255 (PR0009)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\lex_strings_err_escape.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\lex_strings_err_escape.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe lex_strings_err_escape;

begin
  println("{}", "\400"); // ERROR PR0009@17: invalid string literal: octal escape sequence out of range
end.
